      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "谢谢你能够认真地接受它。\n虽然你向来都是这么做的……\n但是此刻、比以往都要认真呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a0d59637dba7d1d7dddffb7e2bc3ae45d1adfccd59b810b0ab5ce40d2be08c2",
