      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……都在一点一点地改变呢。\n我也是、你也是……我们都是。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b231a54bb0662ab748d84981f56e507abdd8d55941b4bdb8bc32159d8b40269",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
