    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c576c3ce15fc0d8009fcce91",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即将迎来春天的粉丝大感谢祭！\n为回馈广大粉丝们的支持、\n赛马娘们会通过参加各种竞技带来欢笑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c10652d3924fe80dc13272fd3a33ee848a6527c3bcb9209915b12afebcb2656f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
