      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迷人景致的队伍由、『Unrivaled』\n『Reach the Crown』『A Shin Beatlon』\n……一同出道的伙伴们组成。",
      "source_fingerprint": "61ea282f7be7c827e6ae63964b86d5c47583ace24a1fca6071a1af98bb200fb7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
